    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d844">

                <pb facs="0940" n="746" sameAs="frus:frus1945Berlinv02/pg746"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 Control (Rumania)/7–2345:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head>No. 844<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Acting Representative in Rumania</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Melbourne</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Extract<anchor n="1" xml:id="d844-f1"/>]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1945-07-28T13:00:00-04:00">July 28, 1945—1 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>378. …</p>
                <p>. . . . . . . .</p>
                <p>… On the six articles mentioned in his<anchor n="2" xml:id="d844-f2"/>
                    M–1285<anchor n="3" xml:id="d844-f3"/> his views
                    are in general concurred in by Dept. We would
                    not, however, regard any specific protest on Article 7 as called for at the
                    present time since Soviet Govt has several times been apprised of this Govt’s
                    position and matter is under discussion at governmental level as part of
                    question of defining war booty in all ex-enemy
                    countries. …</p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p>
                <closer><signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        S[amuel] R[eber]
                    </signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d844-f1" n="1" xml:id="d844-f1-content">
                <p>For the full text of this message, see <ref target="#d825">document No.
                    825</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d844-f2" n="2" xml:id="d844-f2-content">
                <p>i. e., Brigadier General
                    Schuyler’s.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d844-f3" n="3" xml:id="d844-f3-content">
                <p>See <ref target="#d812">documents Nos. 812</ref> and <ref target="#d840"
                        >840</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
